WEBVTT

00:06:38.477 --> 00:06:42.606
What you're seeing here are the records
of my students burning.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.277
We set this fire

00:06:47.945 --> 00:06:51.407
to protect every girl
who's ever studied at SOLA.

00:06:53.492 --> 00:06:55.286
This was mid-August.

00:06:56.537 --> 00:06:59.415
Right as the Taliban
were about to enter Kabul.